            "line": 324,
            "text": "theorem nativeArgument_expanded (h : ℝ) {n : ℕ} (hn : 1 ≤ n) :\n    nativeArgument h n =\n      ((n : ℝ) * (1 + h) * Real.log 2 - 2 * Real.log (n : ℝ)) / Real.log coverGrowth"
